<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>내 페이지</title>
  <style>
    .my-page { width: min(100% - 32px, 1050px); margin: 32px auto 64px; }
    .my-page h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #14243c; }
    .my-page .lead { color: #64748b; font-size: .95rem; }
    .my-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin: 18px 0; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, .05); }
    .my-card h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .my-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px 24px; }
    .my-item dt { font-size: .8rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .my-item dd { font-size: .97rem; color: #14243c; font-weight: 550; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .my-shortcuts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .my-shortcuts a { min-width: 130px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .my-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .my-card { padding: 18px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('header') %>
  <main class="my-page">
    <h1>내 페이지</h1>
    <p class="lead">등록된 내 정보와 사용할 수 있는 업무 메뉴를 확인하세요.</p>
    <section class="my-card" aria-labelledby="myJobTitle">
      <h2 id="myJobTitle">직원 정보</h2>
      <dl class="my-grid">
        <div class="my-item"><dt>이름</dt><dd><%= employee.name || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>사번</dt><dd><%= employee.empNo || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>소속</dt><dd><%= employee.orgType || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>부서</dt><dd><%= employee.department || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>직급</dt><dd><%= employee.position || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>고용형태</dt><dd><%= employee.employmentType || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>입사일</dt><dd><%= employee.hireDate ? new Date(employee.hireDate).toISOString().slice(0, 10) : '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>재직상태</dt><dd><%= employee.status || '-' %></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
    <section class="my-card" aria-labelledby="myContactTitle">
      <h2 id="myContactTitle">연락 정보</h2>
      <dl class="my-grid">
        <div class="my-item"><dt>이메일</dt><dd><%= employee.email || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>휴대폰</dt><dd><%= employee.mobile || '-' %></dd></div>
        <div class="my-item"><dt>주소</dt><dd><%= employee.address || '-' %></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
    <section class="my-card" aria-labelledby="myLinksTitle">
      <h2 id="myLinksTitle">바로가기</h2>
      <div class="my-shortcuts">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/directory">직원찾기</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/uniform">내 유니폼</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/boards">게시판</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/notice">공지사항</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('footer') %>
</body>
</html>
